on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 7 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [  7] extcall 8 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [  9] pushint8 41 ............................. <41>
  [ 12] pusharglist 1 ........................... <41>
  [ 14] extcall 5 ............................... <rollOver(41)>
  [ 16] jmpifz [ 35] ............................ if rollOver(41) then
  [ 19] pushint8 44 ............................. <44>
  [ 22] pushint8 41 ............................. <41>
  [ 25] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 28] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 41>
  [ 30] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 33] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 44 to the locV of sprite 41
  [ 35] pushint8 42 ............................. <42>
  [ 38] pusharglist 1 ........................... <42>
  [ 40] extcall 5 ............................... <rollOver(42)>
  [ 42] jmpifz [ 61] ............................ if rollOver(42) then
  [ 45] pushint8 44 ............................. <44>
  [ 48] pushint8 42 ............................. <42>
  [ 51] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 54] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 42>
  [ 56] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 59] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 44 to the locV of sprite 42
  [ 61] pushint8 43 ............................. <43>
  [ 64] pusharglist 1 ........................... <43>
  [ 66] extcall 5 ............................... <rollOver(43)>
  [ 68] jmpifz [ 87] ............................ if rollOver(43) then
  [ 71] pushint8 44 ............................. <44>
  [ 74] pushint8 43 ............................. <43>
  [ 77] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 80] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 43>
  [ 82] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 85] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 44 to the locV of sprite 43
  [ 87] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 89] extcall 6 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 91] ret
end
